<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (On the restaurant side, Zomato hosts 1,436 menu items, with an average price of 196.91 per dish. Outlets like Agrawal Sweets lead in revenue, and the top cuisines contribute the bulk of sales. Pricing trends reveal customer sensitivity to high menu rates, while city-level analysis highlights Bikaner, Bangalore, and Delhi as hotspots. This project helped me use SQL and Power BI to turn raw transactional data into meaningful insights, uncovering profit drivers, customer patterns, and growth opportunities for the food delivery industry.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
